# API base URL for the real backend (/backend).
# - Same Wi-Fi as the dev machine: use the machine's LAN IP, e.g. http://10.8.1.167:5000/api/v1
# - Phone on a DIFFERENT network: tunnel the backend (ngrok/localtunnel/cloudflared) and paste the https URL here.
